      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate's gross claims outstanding at 1 January 2018 were GBP 262.391m. Analysis of the gross claims development table shows no material aggregate prior-year movement for underwriting years through 2016 (net movement across older years effectively nil), indicating a flat prior-year development at the 2018 year-end. The accounts note favourable settlements affecting 2015 and prior years (generating a GBP 9.4m pre-expense profit from the 2015 RITC) and also reference catastrophe activity in 2017 (Harvey, Irma, Maria) and 2018 (Florence, Michael, California wildfires), but these did not produce a material gross prior-year strengthening at the 2018 reporting date.",
